# Documentation

- Code and tests are the source of truth. `docs/DEVELOPER_DOCS.md` is partly outdated (Postgres/Redis, `/api/links`, Brevly branding).
- When docs and code disagree, follow code unless the user asked to change the contract.
- Do not create new markdown files unless the user asked.
- Verify paths, script names, env vars, and routes before documenting them.
- Live API shape is `{ success, message, ... }` with routes under `/api/auth` and `/api/urls` — not the `/api/links` contract in the stale doc.
